        "# File object\n",
        "\n",
        "A file object provides an interface for reading or writing a stream, typically created by `open()`. It can operate in text or binary mode.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-file-object)"
